# Start & Preview

Start the app dev server from the repo root:

```bash
yarn start
```

This runs the `excalidraw-app` Vite dev server on `http://localhost:3000` (override with `VITE_APP_PORT`).

- Run it as a long-running/background process; don't block waiting on it.
- Wait until Vite prints the local URL before opening the browser.
- Then open `http://localhost:3000` in the Cursor browser to preview.
